{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AfterQuest</strong> blends a lore-rich, party-based RPG experience with tactical turn-based combat, deep character builds, and the fast-paced action from modern roguelite dungeon crawlers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death Restarts Your Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat is forbidden. Each time your party falls, a mysterious guardian spirit pulls them back from the void. Secrets unravel, power grows through loot and experience, and the fight against the Dark Lord\u2019s corruption begins anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/d8163a718454fe90ce021e20d93b7c59.poster.avif?t=1773076663\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/d8163a718454fe90ce021e20d93b7c59.webm?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/d8163a718454fe90ce021e20d93b7c59.mp4?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Your True Potential</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a three-member party, each wielding beautifully animated, class-specific spells with their own modifiers, gear, and permanent perks. Mix runes, stack status effects, and compound multipliers for endless build paths and epic payoffs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/c75f63105ae41a4ce5fea47ab9f78ba2.poster.avif?t=1773076663\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/c75f63105ae41a4ce5fea47ab9f78ba2.webm?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/c75f63105ae41a4ce5fea47ab9f78ba2.mp4?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover a Character-Driven Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds around the campfire between runs as your party reveals their pasts. In battle, confront corrupted foes and uncover the motives that led them astray. With every run, the line between hero and villain grows thinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/1d7d635351271d40207a96d1aff0a5ce.poster.avif?t=1773076663\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/1d7d635351271d40207a96d1aff0a5ce.webm?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/1d7d635351271d40207a96d1aff0a5ce.mp4?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strike Fast, Think Faster</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in AfterQuest is crafted to be both <strong>strategic and fast-paced</strong>. With an ARPG-style interface and no menus to slow you down, spells and attacks fire off instantly while still showcasing their nostalgic, hand-crafted animations. Every encounter becomes a <strong>tactical puzzle</strong>, shaped by elemental interactions, gear choices, and consumables that reward smart planning and quick decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/faee6d0171505fd42b37d0ecfba5463e.poster.avif?t=1773076663\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/faee6d0171505fd42b37d0ecfba5463e.webm?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/faee6d0171505fd42b37d0ecfba5463e.mp4?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Gauntlet, Conquer the Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone is filled with ruthless encounters, side quests, and hidden challenges that culminate in a climactic final boss. Conquer them to advance, or fall and return to camp where permanent upgrades prepare you for a stronger attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/a3c12505082c16048cb81ae2e9c9f64d.poster.avif?t=1773076663\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/a3c12505082c16048cb81ae2e9c9f64d.webm?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/extras/a3c12505082c16048cb81ae2e9c9f64d.mp4?t=1773076663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484950?t=1773076663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773076663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/7e38f8bf80f616c27848a9490104a5d29ead85d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773076663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484950/7e38f8bf80f616c27848a9490104a5d29ead85d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773076663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id"